      "message": "fix(import): a STEP re-import keeps the model's recorded facet budget\n\nWithout an explicit budget (GUI session setting never committed, or an\nMCP/script import without facet_budget) a STEP import onto an existing\nmodel now runs under the budget recorded with it, so a restart no longer\nre-meshes it at the default. An explicit budget wins and is recorded.\n\nFixes #1185\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
